{
  "total_duration_s": 139.625,
  "lead_s": 0.8,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "stop_id": 1,
      "text": "这是一条两天的盘锦自驾路线。我们从盘锦站出发，先看城市人文，再向南驶入辽河口湿地，最后在红海滩收束。全程约一百四十三公里，纯驾驶约两小时四十二分钟。",
      "raw_audio": "audio-work/raw/00-intro.mp3",
      "wav": "audio-work/wav/00-intro.wav",
      "ssml": "audio-work/ssml/00-intro.ssml",
      "duration_s": 16.344,
      "sha256": "7091ea4b3e84de03551d17f7cc758dce1571e199655598f8c5ed9c95efec501c",
      "start_s": 0.8,
      "speech_end_s": 17.144,
      "end_s": 18.144,
      "gap_after_s": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "stop-1",
      "stop_id": 1,
      "text": "第一站是盘锦站。建议在站区取车或预约包车，确认两天行程后再出发。",
      "raw_audio": "audio-work/raw/01-stop-1.mp3",
      "wav": "audio-work/wav/01-stop-1.wav",
      "ssml": "audio-work/ssml/01-stop-1.ssml",
      "duration_s": 8.016,
      "sha256": "bb8560f63b9f1ab72ed4e3cffe9a7853c6ccc14c2143e9af51f558725763baa1",
      "start_s": 18.144,
      "speech_end_s": 26.16,
      "end_s": 27.16,
      "gap_after_s": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "stop-2",
      "stop_id": 2,
      "text": "第二站到辽河碑林。这里以不断代的书法碑刻为核心，适合把盘锦的人文线索从辽河岸边展开。",
      "raw_audio": "audio-work/raw/02-stop-2.mp3",
      "wav": "audio-work/wav/02-stop-2.wav",
      "ssml": "audio-work/ssml/02-stop-2.ssml",
      "duration_s": 9.12,
      "sha256": "c2acd1e84dcf938be57e10d7ae642367d95d4ddc6181e81f1480c029e554a0dc",
      "start_s": 27.16,
      "speech_end_s": 36.28,
      "end_s": 37.28,
      "gap_after_s": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "stop-3",
      "stop_id": 3,
      "text": "第三站是辽河湿地公园。沿河停留片刻，先理解这座城市与河流、湿地之间的关系。",
      "raw_audio": "audio-work/raw/03-stop-3.mp3",
      "wav": "audio-work/wav/03-stop-3.wav",
      "ssml": "audio-work/ssml/03-stop-3.ssml",
      "duration_s": 8.856,
      "sha256": "36f2a76747f72e36f5ba57765554ebcab149dd01440cf31dc8d01a2b5778e67f",
      "start_s": 37.28,
      "speech_end_s": 46.136,
      "end_s": 47.136,
      "gap_after_s": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "stop-4",
      "stop_id": 4,
      "text": "第四站到盘锦市博物馆。馆址位于兴隆台烽火台旧址，展览以辽河变迁串联盘锦的历史。",
      "raw_audio": "audio-work/raw/04-stop-4.mp3",
      "wav": "audio-work/wav/04-stop-4.wav",
      "ssml": "audio-work/ssml/04-stop-4.ssml",
      "duration_s": 9.24,
      "sha256": "74f5f21d0c9862b68cc92cc5ae76d0cf0fe5eb0ef804de531e8d48175dde24a2",
      "start_s": 47.136,
      "speech_end_s": 56.376,
      "end_s": 57.376,
      "gap_after_s": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "stop-5",
      "stop_id": 5,
      "text": "第五站是广厦艺术街。这里集中书画、文创和非遗空间，傍晚到访更适合衔接夜间休闲。",
      "raw_audio": "audio-work/raw/05-stop-5.mp3",
      "wav": "audio-work/wav/05-stop-5.wav",
      "ssml": "audio-work/ssml/05-stop-5.ssml",
      "duration_s": 9.36,
      "sha256": "3ca3df069e2a8f98663826746f56338624e2176da9f67491fdaf5a2c473a0a9e",
      "start_s": 57.376,
      "speech_end_s": 66.736,
      "end_s": 67.736,
      "gap_after_s": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "stop-6",
      "stop_id": 6,
      "text": "第六站是北旅田园黑风关古镇。它是唐风主题文旅景区，不是唐代遗址，适合安排演艺和夜游。",
      "raw_audio": "audio-work/raw/06-stop-6.mp3",
      "wav": "audio-work/wav/06-stop-6.wav",
      "ssml": "audio-work/ssml/06-stop-6.ssml",
      "duration_s": 9.6,
      "sha256": "16c00c2299dd55d18209e14c9f72b3be7e5f188029378c4efeaea4581e5f54f0",
      "start_s": 67.736,
      "speech_end_s": 77.336,
      "end_s": 79.136,
      "gap_after_s": 1.8
    },
    {
      "id": "stop-7",
      "stop_id": 7,
      "text": "第二天从田庄台镇开始。这里不是统一售票景区，可以组合甲午末战遗址、非遗展馆、老街和当地小吃。",
      "raw_audio": "audio-work/raw/07-stop-7.mp3",
      "wav": "audio-work/wav/07-stop-7.wav",
      "ssml": "audio-work/ssml/07-stop-7.ssml",
      "duration_s": 10.608,
      "sha256": "cd90efabe004ab7c13973b768cc5fa6481458bad6c86b7040cd2c0afab635a66",
      "start_s": 79.136,
      "speech_end_s": 89.744,
      "end_s": 90.744,
      "gap_after_s": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "stop-8",
      "stop_id": 8,
      "text": "第八站到江南风情园。这里是滨海沿线的园林休闲节点，适合短暂停留，再向红海滩方向行驶。",
      "raw_audio": "audio-work/raw/08-stop-8.mp3",
      "wav": "audio-work/wav/08-stop-8.wav",
      "ssml": "audio-work/ssml/08-stop-8.ssml",
      "duration_s": 9.672,
      "sha256": "bcabec0bbea2e0fe912659b13157e8a9146a2972bb030ac78c0992871dc962e2",
      "start_s": 90.744,
      "speech_end_s": 100.416,
      "end_s": 101.816,
      "gap_after_s": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "stop-9",
      "stop_id": 9,
      "text": "第九站是红海滩游客中心。社会车辆应按当天规定停车或换乘，不要把保护区内部景观点直接设成驾车终点。",
      "raw_audio": "audio-work/raw/09-stop-9.mp3",
      "wav": "audio-work/wav/09-stop-9.wav",
      "ssml": "audio-work/ssml/09-stop-9.ssml",
      "duration_s": 11.256,
      "sha256": "f094271e0eaf5e73ac6439e231a450f713ab9ff75ae1992f28d88b51c6b135c4",
      "start_s": 101.816,
      "speech_end_s": 113.072,
      "end_s": 114.072,
      "gap_after_s": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "stop-10",
      "stop_id": 10,
      "text": "最后来到踏霞漫步。红滩景观会随季节、潮位和植物状态变化，只进入景区开放道路、栈道和观景点。",
      "raw_audio": "audio-work/raw/10-stop-10.mp3",
      "wav": "audio-work/wav/10-stop-10.wav",
      "ssml": "audio-work/ssml/10-stop-10.ssml",
      "duration_s": 11.016,
      "sha256": "52a707d028ae346c5911ac433833ed758308bb9beef4d552b2fffcb6ef96906c",
      "start_s": 114.072,
      "speech_end_s": 125.088,
      "end_s": 126.088,
      "gap_after_s": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "outro",
      "stop_id": 10,
      "text": "这条路线把城市人文、主题夜游、古镇历史和滨海湿地串在一起。出发前，请再次核对开放时间和景区交通。",
      "raw_audio": "audio-work/raw/11-outro.mp3",
      "wav": "audio-work/wav/11-outro.wav",
      "ssml": "audio-work/ssml/11-outro.ssml",
      "duration_s": 11.328,
      "sha256": "2e179c515cfa79bc37d9a282e0d334c8a09ccb59a2bed54f3900cdd49516f7ce",
      "start_s": 126.088,
      "speech_end_s": 137.416,
      "end_s": 139.616,
      "gap_after_s": 2.2
    }
  ]
}
